{"version":"1","id":"dwb","handle":"dwb","name":"David Walsh","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/5ecdb402b07a45598472bdd38a38de15","description":null,"is_squad":false,"x":-7.0644,"y":1.5195,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":167,"newest_post_at":"2025-11-20T00:39:07.000Z","oldest_post_at":"2020-08-19T17:15:06.000Z","features":{"hype_score":0.01497,"listicle_ratio":0.035928,"question_ratio":0.0,"avg_read_time":1.640719,"summary_length_avg":279.454545,"title_length_avg":33.868263,"title_length_var":186.737137,"tag_entropy":3.535527,"tag_diversity":0.479042,"top_tag_share":0.263473,"avg_upvotes":5.11976,"median_upvotes":1.0,"avg_comments":0.443114,"comment_to_upvote_ratio":0.087617,"zero_engagement_share":0.329341,"viral_share":0.005988,"posts_per_week":0.609386,"non_article_ratio":0.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"recency_skew":0.006024},"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[4.5147,7.6912],"cadence_depth":[2.2059,-8.2059],"hype_variety":[3.3382,3.6765],"title_style":[-7.0294,7.3088]},"top_tags":[["javascript",55],["css",26],["webdev",22],["html",13],["cli",10],["git",10],["general-programming",7],["devtools",6]],"sample_titles":{"representative":["I\u2019m So Old: Web Edition","How to Create a UUID in JavaScript","HTML popover Attribute"],"outlier":["Unveiling 15+ Essential Tools & Resources for Web Designers and Agencies in 2023"]},"recent_posts":[{"id":"OfxhmLWlv","title":"JavaScript SpeechSynthesis API","url":"https://davidwalsh.name/speechsynthesis-api","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/javascript-speechsynthesis-api-ofxhmlwlv","summary":"The SpeechSynthesis API enables browsers to convert text to speech programmatically using window.speechSynthesis and SpeechSynthesisUtterance. This browser API can enhance accessibility for unsighted users by making the browser audibly speak any text string. While not a replacement for native accessibility tools, it offers a way to supplement existing features with text-to-speech functionality across all modern browsers.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f93259e4c4c34781c96ddaba05612817?_a=AQAEulh","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-11-20T00:39:07.000Z"},{"id":"mCcE5wpsJ","title":"Easy way to upload, transform and deliver files and images","url":"https://davidwalsh.name/easy-way-to-upload-transform-and-deliver-files-and-images","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/easy-way-to-upload-transform-and-deliver-files-and-images-mcce5wpsj","summary":"Managing media files can be challenging, but using a service like Filestack simplifies the process. Filestack allows users to upload files easily from various sources, transform them with a range of effects and formats, and deliver them efficiently via a CDN. It supports multiple programming languages and provides a robust API with extensive documentation.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/16f5980172299931ccc08fdac243ab8a?_a=AQAEuj9","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-03-24T22:58:30.000Z"},{"id":"xyNcuBTt6","title":"How to Download a YouTube Video or Channel","url":"https://davidwalsh.name/download-youtube-mp3","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-download-a-youtube-video-or-channel-xyncubtt6","summary":"Downloading media has evolved from the days of Napster and LimeWire to modern tools like yt-dlp. This tool allows users to download YouTube videos or entire channels, and even convert videos to audio formats like mp3. YouTube-dl was the previous standard, but yt-dlp now leads in functionality.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f93259e4c4c34781c96ddaba05612817?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":7,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-09-04T04:42:36.000Z"},{"id":"GlPIL1XqK","title":"How to Add a Header to a curl Request","url":"https://davidwalsh.name/curl-add-header","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-add-a-header-to-a-curl-request-glpil1xqk","summary":"Curl is a versatile command-line tool used for various tasks like batch downloading files and testing APIs. Use the `-H` flag to add headers to a curl request, with each header specified as `[key]: [value]`. Multiple headers can be added using multiple `-H` flags.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f93259e4c4c34781c96ddaba05612817?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":9,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-08-03T16:51:46.000Z"},{"id":"AnZ63hfOu","title":"Case Insensitive CSS Attribute Selector","url":"https://davidwalsh.name/css-attribute-case","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/case-insensitive-css-attribute-selector-anz63hfou","summary":"CSS selectors offer powerful capabilities for matching complex patterns, including the ability to conduct case insensitive searches for attribute values. By adding an 'i' within the attribute selector brackets, you can match attribute values regardless of their case. However, this feature should be used sparingly due to the potential for issues arising from inconsistent class naming conventions.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f93259e4c4c34781c96ddaba05612817?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":27,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2024-06-19T11:31:27.000Z"},{"id":"evFBgCjGu","title":"How to Set Date Time from Mac Command Line","url":"https://davidwalsh.name/mac-set-date","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-set-date-time-from-mac-command-line-evfbgcjgu","summary":"Learn how to quickly change the date on your Mac using the command line","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f93259e4c4c34781c96ddaba05612817?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-06-17T12:01:38.000Z"},{"id":"1vV1NCVpS","title":"How to Retrieve WiFi Password on Windows","url":"https://davidwalsh.name/retrieve-wifi-password-windows","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-retrieve-wifi-password-on-windows-1vv1ncvps","summary":"Learn how to retrieve WiFi password on Windows using a built-in command.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f93259e4c4c34781c96ddaba05612817?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":6,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-13T10:45:29.000Z"},{"id":"iS2xPlWck","title":"How to Fix: Windows WASD Keys Reversed with Arrow Keys","url":"https://davidwalsh.name/fix-wasd-keys","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-fix-windows-wasd-keys-reversed-with-arrow-keys-is2xplwck","summary":"Learn how to fix reversed WASD keys with arrow keys in Windows by using a simple key combination.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f93259e4c4c34781c96ddaba05612817?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-02T01:55:27.000Z"},{"id":"EWyDfM9V3","title":"HTML popover Attribute","url":"https://davidwalsh.name/html-popover-attribute","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/html-popover-attribute-ewydfm9v3","summary":"Learn how to create a native HTML modal using the popover attribute and style its contents. Discover how to add a background layer to the popover modal.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/33dd2cee236302d0f49452496507ac17?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":50,"num_comments":7,"created_at":"2024-04-15T11:19:02.000Z"},{"id":"EoXSRnPjP","title":"Get Started in AI and NFTs with the Limewire API","url":"https://davidwalsh.name/get-started-in-ai-and-nfts-with-the-limewire-api","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/get-started-in-ai-and-nfts-with-the-limewire-api-eoxsrnpjp","summary":"LimeWire has released its Developer API, allowing engineers to create dynamic AI art and generate images based on text and other images. The API supports multiple programming languages and provides clean and easy-to-understand documentation.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f93259e4c4c34781c96ddaba